WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.719 --> 00:00:05.240
There is a story that's hugely important but
not necessarily for the reasons a lot of people

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:06.240
think.

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:12.040
The Chinese doctor who was the whistle blower
about Corona virus has died now immediately

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:17.769
a ton of articles and a ton of people started
saying or implying the Chinese government

00:00:17.769 --> 00:00:21.499
killed the doctor and that that's the scandal.

00:00:21.499 --> 00:00:26.699
The doctor appears to have genuinely died
of Corona virus himself, which he contracted

00:00:26.699 --> 00:00:30.819
while working at [inaudible] central hospital
in China.

00:00:30.819 --> 00:00:35.890
The scandal and the controversy is that the
Chinese government appears to have sent police

00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:40.700
to tell him to shut up about Corona virus
after he sent out a warning via chat group

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:44.490
to other doctors on December 30th about Corona
virus.

00:00:44.490 --> 00:00:46.500
We're talking about 34 year old.

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:53.360
Dr. Lee wen Liang, who was an ophthalmologist,
noticed seven cases of a virus that looked

00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:55.180
to him like SARS.

00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:59.450
He sent a message to doctors in a chat group
saying, you should wear protective clothing

00:00:59.450 --> 00:01:01.020
when you're with patients.

00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:04.220
Four days later, as reported by the BBC.

00:01:04.220 --> 00:01:09.130
He was summoned by the public security Bureau
where he was told to sign a letter which,

00:01:09.130 --> 00:01:15.710
uh, accused him of quote making false comments
that had quote severely disturbed the social

00:01:15.710 --> 00:01:16.710
order.

00:01:16.710 --> 00:01:21.900
He was one of eight people who police say
were being investigated for spreading rumors.

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:26.520
Local authorities later apologized to him
because of course he was completely right

00:01:26.520 --> 00:01:32.620
about Corona virus, but more importantly,
a few days later on 10th he started coughing.

00:01:32.620 --> 00:01:34.170
Then he had a fever.

00:01:34.170 --> 00:01:40.090
Then he was in the hospital, diagnosed with
Corona virus on the 30th of January and ultimately

00:01:40.090 --> 00:01:41.610
has passed away.

00:01:41.610 --> 00:01:46.910
So as of right now, I do not believe that
the Chinese government killed him.

00:01:46.910 --> 00:01:52.479
I believe he died of exactly what he was worried
about, which is Corona virus contracted from

00:01:52.479 --> 00:01:53.479
patients.

00:01:53.479 --> 00:02:00.670
The real concern is that the Chinese government
has prioritized silencing doctors rather than

00:02:00.670 --> 00:02:04.240
immediately moving to deal with Corona virus.

00:02:04.240 --> 00:02:09.240
And I want to be really careful because the
entire Corona virus story has been used in

00:02:09.240 --> 00:02:16.110
some enclaves to justify discriminatory and
disgusting comments about Chinese people and

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:17.350
Chinese culture.

00:02:17.350 --> 00:02:18.500
That's not what I'm doing.

00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:20.710
This is a critique of the Chinese government.

00:02:20.710 --> 00:02:25.810
Now, just to circle back around to the conspiracy
theory piece, that the Chinese government

00:02:25.810 --> 00:02:31.420
killed this guy to silence him, that he didn't
die of Corona viruses of go of Corona virus.

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:35.480
I'm not blind to the atrocities committed
by the Chinese government over the last many

00:02:35.480 --> 00:02:36.480
decades.

00:02:36.480 --> 00:02:38.239
I'm not pretending they don't exist.

00:02:38.239 --> 00:02:41.130
We don't have evidence that that's what happened.

00:02:41.130 --> 00:02:44.570
So I don't believe that it is prudent or responsible
to push it.

00:02:44.570 --> 00:02:48.870
Now, there are some people who said, you know,
this guy was 34 Corona virus is really killing

00:02:48.870 --> 00:02:50.290
little kids in the elderly.

00:02:50.290 --> 00:02:52.990
How did a 34 year old die of it?

00:02:52.990 --> 00:02:59.410
That's mostly true, but there are people of
just sort of medium ages that have died of

00:02:59.410 --> 00:03:00.410
Corona virus.

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:05.680
I'm not ignoring the possibility that there
is more to this, but right now it does not

00:03:05.680 --> 00:03:09.900
seem responsible to push that the Chinese
government killed this guy.

00:03:09.900 --> 00:03:14.890
It does seem that the Chinese government was
more concerned with covering up the existence

00:03:14.890 --> 00:03:20.300
of Corona virus early on than in moving quickly
and swiftly to actually deal with it.

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:28.720
The latest numbers, 38,000 cases, 815 deaths,
nearly 3000 people have recovered so far.

00:03:28.720 --> 00:03:32.610
So far there is a lower death rate with Corona
virus than with SARS.

00:03:32.610 --> 00:03:38.519
The death rate is about 2% with SARS it was
about 10 to 15%, but the number of infections

00:03:38.519 --> 00:03:44.980
is significantly larger and more than likely
it's going to end up killing many more people.

00:03:44.980 --> 00:03:46.900
Very, very sad what's going on.

00:03:46.900 --> 00:03:51.470
And certainly anytime a government works to
cover something up rather than to actually

00:03:51.470 --> 00:03:54.620
deal with it, it is concerning for the entire
world.

00:03:54.620 --> 00:03:56.950
As we are quickly seeing cases start to spread
all over the world.

